{"name":"Blush","hex":"#f29e8e","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"blush","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["An act of blushing; a pink or red glow on the face caused by embarrassment, shame, shyness, love, etc.","A glow; a flush of colour, especially pink or red."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To become red or pink in the face (and sometimes experience an associated feeling of warmth), especially due to shyness, love, shame, excitement, or embarrassment.","To be shy, ashamed, or embarrassed (to do something)."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/blush"}],"entries":[{"title":"Blushing","blocks":[{"text":"Blushing or erubescence is the reddening of a person's face due to psychological reasons. It is normally involuntary and triggered by emotional stress associated with passion, embarrassment, shyness, fear, anger, or romantic stimulation."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/01/Blushing_girl_0001.jpg/330px-Blushing_girl_0001.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blushing","wikidata":"Q1338786"},{"title":"Rouge (cosmetics)","blocks":[{"text":"Rouge, also called blush or blusher, is a cosmetic for coloring the cheeks in a variety of shades, or the lips red. It is applied as a powder, cream or liquid."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/19/Make-up_box_MAN_Paestum_T.4-1990.jpg/330px-Make-up_box_MAN_Paestum_T.4-1990.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rouge_(cosmetics)","wikidata":"Q181791"},{"title":"Blush (color)","blocks":[{"text":"Blush is a medium bright tone of pink."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bf/Blush_rose_1.jpg/330px-Blush_rose_1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blush_(color)","wikidata":"Q22133966"},{"title":"Blush (Asian band)","blocks":[{"text":"Blush was a Hong Kong–based Asian girl group originally composed of five members from the Philippines, India, China, Japan, and South Korea. They were formed by FarWest Entertainment in 2010 with the intent of popularizing an Asian vocal act in the United States as well as in all of Asia. They perform in the English language and the members currently reside in Los Angeles, California. A reality show called Project Lotus: The Search for Blush about how the band was formed premiered on Channel V on March 8, 2012. They were the first Asian group to have its debut single hit the top 3 on a major US Billboard chart when \"Undivided\" featuring Snoop Dogg reached No. 3 on the Billboard Dance/Play Chart. Their second single, \"Dance On\", reached No. 1 on that chart."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bf/Blush_Band_on_RealTVfilms.jpg/330px-Blush_Band_on_RealTVfilms.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blush_(Asian_band)","wikidata":"Q196696"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d9/Ladies_fresco_from_Akrotiri%2C_17th_c_BC%2C_PMTh%2C_226251.jpg/120px-Ladies_fresco_from_Akrotiri%2C_17th_c_BC%2C_PMTh%2C_226251.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d9/Ladies_fresco_from_Akrotiri%2C_17th_c_BC%2C_PMTh%2C_226251.jpg/250px-Ladies_fresco_from_Akrotiri%2C_17th_c_BC%2C_PMTh%2C_226251.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d9/Ladies_fresco_from_Akrotiri%2C_17th_c_BC%2C_PMTh%2C_226251.jpg/120px-Ladies_fresco_from_Akrotiri%2C_17th_c_BC%2C_PMTh%2C_226251.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ALadies_fresco_from_Akrotiri%